schema: "0.3"
id: echo-of-manifestation-env-shattered-observatory
type: image
service: gemini

prompt:
  text: >
    Dark fantasy concept art of the Shattered Observatory — Zone 5 of the Twilight Zone.
    A grand observatory where the dome has been shattered open, revealing not sky but a
    deep space purple void filled with wrong constellations — stars arranged in transmutation
    circle patterns, nebulae that form alchemical symbols. Massive brass telescopes lie
    toppled and broken, their lenses cracked, pointed at celestial bodies that should not
    exist. The observatory's interior walls are covered with star charts and astronomical
    instruments, but the constellations drawn on the charts have been altered — original
    star positions crossed out and corrected to show the Echo-plane's sky. Zero-gravity
    debris floats throughout the space — broken telescope parts, shattered brass instruments,
    star chart fragments, glass lens shards, and pieces of the dome — all drifting slowly
    as if gravity has given up here. Deep space purple dominates the palette, with brass
    and tarnished gold accents from the instruments. The main telescope mount, an enormous
    brass apparatus, stands broken at the center, its gears stripped and frozen. The floor
    is a giant astronomical chart, its lines glowing faintly amber. The atmosphere is
    intellectual hubris punished — those who studied the heavens learned that the heavens
    were studying them back. Painterly style, atmospheric lighting from the void above
    and amber floor glow below.
  negative: "bright, cheerful, cartoon, anime, clean magic, intact observatory, normal starry sky, blue sky, colorful palette, modern planetarium, low detail, flat shading, realistic space photography"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1536
    height: 1024
    aspect_ratio: "3:2"

tags: [environment, zone-5, observatory, space, astronomy, concept-art, dark-fantasy]
